---
title: "Proof beats promises on every sales call"
description: "Show the before and after. Stop narrating your potential."
date: "2026-07-18"
tags:
  - growth
  - saas
published: true
layout: docs
---

Buyers are tired of vision decks. They've heard "AI-powered" a thousand times.

What closes is proof. Here's what was broken. Here's what runs now. Here's the number that moved.

I keep Algility conversations short on theory and long on receipts. Screenshots. Workflows. Outcomes. If I can't show it, I shouldn't sell it yet.

Promises create skepticism. Proof creates urgency.

Build something real enough to screenshot. Then sell that.
